      "text": "不但",
      "file": "frame-connect-not-only-2-1.mp3",
      "sha256": "a831f6c597892d5b240c4d3b7c7e508e2511d859ce5e3f70c1e5a34773e60c16"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-not-only-2-4",
      "text": "而且",
      "file": "frame-connect-not-only-2-4.mp3",
      "sha256": "7815c857e8c01eaef5520431a0d52e04eb5e1dc74e648ef2f1a41adee13e837e"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-besides-1",
      "text": "除了咖啡，我还喜欢喝茶。",
      "file": "frame-connect-besides-1.mp3",
      "sha256": "57a640c5ba41e83cacf18ca4b82c74c9dd7444f85c3f24d15fe8777fb11f9b4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-besides-1-0",
      "text": "除了",
      "file": "frame-connect-besides-1-0.mp3",
      "sha256": "71ee6170a9370b8021bcd23c6abe941e874e11b740f888bcd008deee4246b75b"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-besides-1-4",
      "text": "还",
      "file": "frame-connect-besides-1-4.mp3",
      "sha256": "9d57175e2509a563a6fe684b485fcadfc8b3b813030920339e092adcd31c8ba1"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-not-only-1",
      "text": "这家餐厅不但便宜，而且干净。",
      "file": "frame-connect-not-only-1.mp3",
      "sha256": "0cd74ced41208cde301fbdf27e57cd94b591a20dafd4e73b2f0335f535275f35"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-besides-2-0",
      "text": "除了",
      "file": "frame-connect-besides-2-0.mp3",
      "sha256": "71ee6170a9370b8021bcd23c6abe941e874e11b740f888bcd008deee4246b75b"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-besides-2-4",
      "text": "还",
      "file": "frame-connect-besides-2-4.mp3",
      "sha256": "9d57175e2509a563a6fe684b485fcadfc8b3b813030920339e092adcd31c8ba1"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-besides-2",
      "text": "除了上课，他还在书店工作。",
      "file": "frame-connect-besides-2.mp3",
      "sha256": "139a7c3ad0009ab887844486b28cc3c0dd7112513b2a2ef86351ba34493c261f"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-no-matter-1-0",
      "text": "不管",
      "file": "frame-connect-no-matter-1-0.mp3",
      "sha256": "d2cf4ad61977002a131e4d21680d63e84fb41599e89d4055281479a3c882dcdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-no-matter-1-4",
      "text": "都",
      "file": "frame-connect-no-matter-1-4.mp3",
      "sha256": "a4ade13b6c65dd71842df5869f8b541027e8cd1b728e7474123cc523150243b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-only-if-2",
      "text": "只有买了票，你才能进展览馆。",
      "file": "frame-connect-only-if-2.mp3",
      "sha256": "89e3ec278615d88d232c1ce1b60ec83795d9eb7188a32cf4887ed8f9cf02cb0a"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-no-matter-2-0",
      "text": "不管",
      "file": "frame-connect-no-matter-2-0.mp3",
      "sha256": "d2cf4ad61977002a131e4d21680d63e84fb41599e89d4055281479a3c882dcdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-no-matter-2-4",
      "text": "都",
      "file": "frame-connect-no-matter-2-4.mp3",
      "sha256": "a4ade13b6c65dd71842df5869f8b541027e8cd1b728e7474123cc523150243b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-no-matter-2",
      "text": "不管明天下不下雨，我们都去图书馆。",
