    },
    {
      "id": "frame-connect-no-matter-1",
      "text": "不管你选哪本书，我都愿意读。",
      "file": "frame-connect-no-matter-1.mp3",
      "sha256": "1bf81b6195869db0b62d52f89496f801e98d813a5462268d80483cae3772fa39"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-complement-bei-2-1",
      "text": "被",
      "file": "frame-complement-bei-2-1.mp3",
      "sha256": "0f20b317693de5ddb2201a88c2da9953e68f2b87d7a4d503a9a3f7b3d3db3d20"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame-complement-de-1",
      "text": "他说得很清楚。",
      "file": "frame-complement-de-1.mp3",
      "sha256": "f4701924fbf7ff490ca02c9451586cacd1e7577ca529bc1ab853b8eb0695ea63"
    },
